#* '''c. 160-220 {{C.E.}}''', [[w:Tertullian|Tertullian]], ''De Judicio Domini'', 22
#*: quid faciat laetis ut vitis '''abaestuet''' uvis
#*:: What makes a vine hang down richly with grapes

