# {{lb|la|of animals}} to [[hunt]], [[chase]], [[pursue]]
# to drive [[to and fro]], [[toss]] about, [[agitate]], [[disturb]]
# to [[rouse]] or [[stir]] up, [[excite]], [[move]], [[urge]], drive or impel someone to something, [[insist]] on
# to [[disturb]], [[disquiet]], [[provoke]], agitate, [[vex]], [[trouble]], [[torment]]
#: {{syn|la|fatīgō|turbō|perturbō|sollicitō|angō|concitō|percieō|concieō|cieō|disturbō|īnfestō|irrītō|stimulō|lacessō|ēvertō|peragō|moveō|occīdō|agō|versō|ūrō}}
