## {{lb|la|transferred sense|to [[mental]] objects}} to [[disclose]] something [[unknown]], to [[unveil]], [[reveal]], [[make known]], [[unfold]], [[prove]], [[demonstrate]]; {{q|in general}} to [[explain]], [[recount]]

