Page 665 apoculo: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
{{unc|la}}. If the penultimate vowel was short, perhaps from {{der|la|grc|ἀποκυλίω|t=to roll away, roll back}}. If long, then from {{der|la|grc|ἀπο-||away}} + {{m|la|cūlō}}, another uncertain [[hapax]] from {{m|la|cūlus||arse}}, hence similar in formation to {{m|en|bugger off}}. Other proposals link it to {{m|la|oculus}} and even {{m|la|pōculum}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{la-IPA|apocū̆lō}}
* Note: the length of all the stem vowels is uncertain.

===Verb===
