===Etymology===
{{root|la|ine-pro|*h₂ew-|id1=perceive|*dʰeh₁-}}
From {{inh|la|itc-pro|*awizdjō}}, a compound of {{der|la|ine-pro|*h₂ewis||clearly, manifestly}} (from the root {{m|ine-pro|*h₂ew-||to see, perceive}}) and {{m|ine-pro|*dʰeh₁-|*dʰh₁-ye/o-|to render}}.

Cognates include {{cog|grc|αἰσθάνομαι||to perceive}} (also originally "to render manifest"), whence {{cog|en|aesthetic}}, and {{m|grc|ἀΐω||to perceive, hear}}, Hittite {{m|hit|sc=Xsux|𒌋𒀪𒄭|tr=u-uḫ-ḫi||I see}}, {{cog|gem-pro|*awiz|t=obvious}} and Sanskrit {{m|sa|आविस्|tr=āvís||openly, manifestly, evidently}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{la-IPA|audiō|eccl=yes}}
** {{audio|la|Audio latin pronunciation.ogg|Audio (Ecclesiastical)}}

