Borrowed from {{bor|la|grc|βαρβαρίζω}}, or formed natively as {{af|la|barbarus|-izō}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{la-IPA|barbarizō}}

===Verb===
{{la-verb|1+|barbarizō}}

# to adopt [[foreign]] [[custom]]s or [[speech]]; to act in a manner different from that of the Romans or Greeks
# {{lb|la|pejorative}} to [[speak]] bad [[Latin]]; to use a substandard speech variety; to commit [[solecism]]s or speech [[barbarism]]s

====Conjugation====
{{la-conj|1+|barbarizō}}

