* {{desc|bor=1|fr|barbariser}}
* {{desc|bor=1|it|barbarizzare}}
* {{desc|bor=1|pt|barbarizar}}
* {{desc|bor=1|es|barbarizar}}

===References===
* {{R:TLL|barbarizo|lem=17051}}

===Further reading===
* {{R:Gaffiot}}

