Cognates include {{m|la|pōtō}}, [[w:Proto-Slavic language|Proto-Slavic]] {{m|sla-pro|*piti}} (cf. {{m|sla-pro|*pivo||beer}}), [[w:Ancient Greek language|Ancient Greek]] {{m|grc|πίνω}} and [[w:Sanskrit|Sanskrit]] {{l|sa|पिबति|tr=''píbati''}}.

