{{root|la|ine-pro|*klep-}}
From {{inh|la|itc-pro|*klepō}}, from {{der|la|ine-pro|*klep-}}.

Cognates include {{cog|grc|κλέπτω}} and {{cog|got|𐌷𐌻𐌹𐍆𐌰𐌽}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{la-IPA|clepō}}

===Verb===
{{la-verb|3|clepō|cleps|clept}}

# to [[steal]]
# to [[listen]] secretly

====Usage====
{{m|la|clepor|Clepor}} means "to walk" as in "to get stolen."

====Conjugation====
{{la-conj|3.sigm|clepō|cleps|clept|cleps}}

