===Etymology===
From {{affix|la|con-|cacō}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{la-IPA|concacō}}

===Verb===
{{la-verb|1+|concacō}}

# to [[shit]] on, defile with excrement
#* [[w:Seneca the Younger|Seneca the Younger]]
#*: {{ux|la|Ultima vox eius haec inter homines audita est, cum maiorem sonitum emisisset illa parte qua facilius loquebatur: "vae me, puto, '''concacavi''' me." Quod an fecerit, nescio: omnia certe '''concacavit'''.|t=These were the final words he was heard to utter among men, when he had let out a rather loud noise from that part with which he spoke more easily: "Oh dear, I do believe I've '''shat''' myself." Whether he did so, I don't know - he certainly did '''shit''' all over everything [as emperor].}}

