# to [[relinquish]], [[concede]], [[relent]], [[subside]], [[come to an end]], [[terminate]], [[give up]], [[abandon]]
#: {{syn|la|dēserō|relinquō|omittō|dēdō|dēcēdō|dēstituō|dēficiō|oblīvīscor|cēdō|linquō|dēsinō|dissimulō|trādō|trānsmittō|addīcō|praetereō|dēspondeō|neglegō|pōnō|reddō|dō|remittō|permittō|tribuō|dēferō|trānsferō}}
