# to [[understand]], to [[perceive]], to [[learn]], to [[know]]
#: {{syn|la|comprehendō|dēprehendō|accipiō|cognōscō|teneō|apīscor|apprehendō|capiō|complector|excipiō|exaudiō}}
#: {{ant|la|nesciō|ignōrō}}
