===Etymology 2===
Same prefix and root as above; derivation of the ending is disputed.<ref>{{R:itc:EDL|head=sternō, -ere|page=586}}</ref> Can be interpreted as {{affix|la|con-|sternō|-ō|id3=compound verb|pos3=compound verb suffix}}. Can alternatively be explained as a durative.

