#: {{syn|la|perterreō|terreō|exterreō|conterreō|absterreō|deterreō|exciō}}

=====Conjugation=====
{{la-conj|1+|cōnsternō}}
The perfect stem and perfect passive participle stem may alternatively be ''cōnstrāv-'' and ''cōnstrāt-,'' the same as for ''cōnsternere''.<ref>{{R:la:Schrijver|page=409}}</ref>

