# {{lb|la|of weapons}} to [[shoot]], [[hurl]], [[dart]], [[throw]]
# {{lb|la|of places}} to [[extend]], [[reach]], stretch
# {{lb|la|with infinitive}} to [[exert]] oneself [[vigorously]] to do something, [[apply]] oneself with [[zeal]] to, [[go]] to
# {{lb|la|in auctions}} to vie with in [[bidding]], [[bid]] against
# {{lb|la|with accusative or infinitive}} to [[assert]], [[affirm]] earnestly, [[maintain]] or [[contend]] [[energetically]]
# {{lb|la|intransitive}} to [[dispute]], [[fight]], [[contend]] against, [[compete]], [[vie]] with
# {{lb|la|intransitive|often with ab}} to [[demand]], [[ask]], [[solicit]], [[entreat]], [[beg]] [[earnestly]], [[seek]] to [[gain]]
# {{lb|la|intransitive|figuratively}} to [[exert]], [[pursue]] or [[strive]] for eagerly, strain eagerly, stretch
# {{lb|la|intransitive|figuratively}} to [[seek]] to [[arrive]] at, [[march]], [[journey]] [[hastily]] to, [[hasten]], [[press]] forward, go, [[advance]] rapidly

