* {{desc|pt|continuar}}
* {{desc|ro|continua}}
* {{desc|scn|cuntinuari}}
* {{desc|es|continuar}}

===Etymology 2===
From {{affix|la|continuus|-ō|id2=adverb}}.

====Adverb====
{{la-adv|continuō|-}}

# [[immediately]], [[at once]]
# [[from the first]]
#: {{syn|la|statim|cōnfestim|īlicō|extemplō|prōtinus}}
#* {{Q|la|Jerome|Vulgate|Evangelium secundum Matthaeum|26|74-75|quote=et '''continuo''' gallus cantavit. Et recordatus est Petrus verbi Iesu quod dixerat, "priusquam gallus cantet ter me negabis". Et egressus foras ploravit amare.|t=(''after Peter denies Jesus a third time'') And the rooster '''immediately''' sang. Peter then remembered what Jesus had said, "before the rooster sings, you will deny me three times." And he went outside, and cried bitterly.}}

===Etymology 3===

====Adjective====
