Page 1750 curro: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
{{root|la|ine-pro|*ḱers-}}
From {{inh|la|itc-pro|*korzō}}, from {{der|la|ine-pro|*ḱers-|t=to run}}.

Cognate with {{m|la|currus}}, {{m|la|carrus}} (via {{cog|cel-gau|-}}), {{cog|en|horse}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{la-IPA|currō}}

===Verb===
{{la-verb|3|currō|cucurr|curs}}

