From {{prefix|la|dē-|t1=removing|sort=CALCIO}} {{suffix|la|[[calx]], [[calceus]]|t1=heel”, “shoe|-ō|id2=denominative|pos2=suffix forming first-conjugation verbs}}. Compare {{m|la|calceō|t=I shoe", "I put on shoes}}, {{m|la|discalceō|t=I pull off or remove my shoes}} and its descendants such as French {{m|fr|déchausser}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{la-IPA|dēcalciō}}

===Verb===
{{la-verb|1+|dēcalciō}}

# {{lb|la|New Latin}} to {{l|en|take off}} {{n-g|or}} {{l|en|remove}} {{l|en|shoe|shoes}}

====Conjugation====
{{la-conj|1+|dēcalciō}}

