#* {{Q|la|Virgil|Aeneid|1|569-571|quote=“Seu vōs Hesperiam magnam Sāturniaque arva,<br/>sīve Erycīs fīnīs rēgemque optātis Acestēn,<br/>auxiliō tūtōs '''dīmittam''', opibusque iuvābō.”|trans=''“Whatever your choices – great Hesperia and the fields of Saturn, or the land of Eryx and King Acestes – '''I shall send''' [you] '''forth''' with protective escorts, and help with supplies.” – Queen Dido''}}
# to [[renounce]], [[give up]], [[abandon]], [[forego]], [[forsake]]
