Page 2245 doceo: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
{{root|la|ine-pro|*deḱ-}}
From {{inh|la|itc-pro|*dokeō}}, causative of {{der|la|ine-pro|*deḱ-||to take}}. Cognate with {{cog|grc|δοκέω||I expect, suppose, seem}} and {{cog|grc|δέχομαι||I accept, receive}}. The sense "rehearse, present on stage" is a {{sl|la|grc|διδάσκω|nocap=1}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{la-IPA|doceō}}
* {{audio|la|la-cls-doceo.ogg|Audio (Classical)}}

===Verb===
{{la-verb|2|doceō|docu|doct}}

# to [[teach]], [[instruct]]; [[tell]], [[inform]]; [[show]], [[demonstrate]]
#: {{syn|la|īnstruō|discō|ēdūcō|ērudiō|ēdoceō|imbuō|magistrō|fingō}}
