Page 2247 dogmatizo: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
Borrowed from {{cog|grc|δογματίζω||to opine, decree}}, from {{m|grc|δόγμα||opinion, tenet}}, from {{m|grc|δοκέω||to suppose, think, evince}}, from {{cog|ine-pro|*deḱ-||to take}}. Equivalent to {{af|la|dogma|-izō}} and cognate to {{m|la|doceō}}.

Attested from the 2d century {{CE}} in [[w:Irenaeus|Irenaeus]].

===Pronunciation===
