Page 2248 doleo: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
{{root|la|ine-pro|*delh₁-}}
From {{inh|la|itc-pro|*doleō||hurt, cause pain}}, from {{inh|la|ine-pro|*dolh₁éyeti||divide}}, from {{m|ine-pro|*delh₁-||cut}}. The sense development is thus assumed to be that "divide" came to mean "divide someone into pieces, hurt". Compare {{m|la|dolō||hew, fashion, devise}}.

