# {{lb|la|intransitive}} to be sorry, to [[grieve]] for, [[lament]], [[deplore]]
#* {{Q|la|[[w:Bernard_of_Clairvaux|Bernard of Clairvaux]]|quote=Vulgo dicitur: quod non videt oculus, cor non '''dolet'''|t=It is commonly said: What the eye does not see, the heart does not '''grieve'''}}

