===Verb===
{{la-verb|prefix=[[duo|duābus]] [[sella|sellīs]]|2|sedeō|sēd|sess}}

# to [[fall between two stools]], keep in with both parties, to sit on two stools, to wear two hats, to ride two horses with one ass

