Page 2263 dubito: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
Somewhat uncertain, but likely as a frequentative of {{m|la|dubō}} (attested only as a gloss by Paulus/Festus), denominative of {{m|la||*dubos|in doubt|pos=adj.}}, from {{der|la|ine-pro|*dwi-||two-}} + {{m|ine-pro|*bʰuH-||to be}}. See {{m|la|dubius}} for details. For the relation to "two" cf. {{cog|grc|δισσός||twofold; doubtful}}, {{m|grc|δοιάζω||to be in two minds}} and {{cog|de|Zweifel||doubt}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{la-IPA|dubitō}}

===Verb===
{{la-verb|1+.poet-sync-perf|dubitō}}

# to [[waver]] (in [[opinion]]), be [[uncertain]], [[doubt]], [[question]], be in doubt
#: {{syn|la|errō|vagor|fluitō|pendeō}}
#: {{ant|la|cōnstō}}
# to waver (in coming to a [[decision]]), [[hesitate]], [[delay]]
#: {{syn|la|retardō|tardō|moror|cūnctor|prōtrahō|trahō|differō}}
#: {{ant|la|ruō|accurrō|currō|festīnō|prōvolō|properō|corripiō|affluō|mātūrō}}
# to [[reflect]] upon, [[ponder]], [[consider]], [[deliberate]]
#: {{syn|la|reflectō|perpendō|ponderō|dēlīberō|putō|pendō|cōnsīderō|reputō|cōnsulō|replicō|cōnsultō|circumspiciō|videō|trahō|versō}}

====Conjugation====
{{la-conj|1+.poet-sync-perf|dubitō}}

