* {{R:L&S|ĕdo|edo1}}

===Etymology 2===
{{root|la|ine-pro|*deh₃-}}
From {{af|la|ex-|t1=out of|*dere|t2=put/give}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{la-IPA|ēdō}}

====Verb====
{{la-verb|3|ēdō|ēdid|ēdit}}

# to [[give out]], [[put]] or [[bring]] forth; [[eject]], [[discharge]]
# to [[produce]], [[bear]], [[give birth]] to, [[yield]], [[form]], [[beget]]
# to put forth, [[publish]], [[spread]] abroad, [[circulate]]
#: {{ux|la|Cum tua nōn '''ēdās''', carpis mea carmina, Laelī.|t=Because '''you do''' not '''publish''' your poetry, you criticize mine, Laelius.}}
#: {{ux|la|…cum ille asperrimam epistulam dē sē in vulgus '''ēdidisset'''.|t=…even though '''he had''' publicly '''circulated''' a most scathing letter about him.}}
# to set forth, [[relate]], [[tell]], [[disclose]], [[deliver]], [[announce]], [[declare]]
# to produce, [[perform]], [[show]], [[inflict]], [[bring about]], [[cause]]
# to [[raise]] up, [[lift]], [[elevate]]

