* {{sense|send forth}} {{l|la|ēmittō}}, {{l|la|iaciō}}, {{l|la|mittō}}, {{l|la|praefero}}, {{l|la|profero}}
* {{sense|lift}} {{l|la|levō}}, {{l|la|ēlevō}}, {{l|la|allevō}}, {{l|la|ērigō}}, {{l|la|excellō}}, {{l|la|tollō}}, {{l|la|ēvehō}}, {{l|la|scandō}}, {{l|la|surgō}}, {{l|la|sublīmō}}, {{l|la|ēdō}}
