===Etymology===
{{root|la|ine-pro|*h₁em-}}
From {{inh|la|itc-pro|*emō}}, from {{der|la|ine-pro|*h₁em-||to take, distribute}}, with excrescent ''p'' in ''ēmptum''.

Cognate with {{cog|lt|im̃ti}}, {{cog|cu|имѫ}} and possibly {{cog|xcl|իմանամ}}. Possibly related to {{m+|ine-pro|*nem-||to take or give one's due|pos=|tr=}}, with its descendants {{cog|en|nim}}, {{cog|da|nemme}}, {{cog|nl|nemen}}, {{cog|de|nehmen}}, {{cog|fy|nimme}}, {{cog|grc|νέμω}}.

