===Verb===
{{la-verb|3|ērigō|ērēx|ērēct}}

# {{lb|la|transitive}} to [[raise up]], [[elevate]], [[lift]]
#: {{syn|la|levō|ēlevō|allevō|excellō|ēvehō|tollō|scandō|efferō|surgō|ēdō|sublīmō}}
#: {{ant|la|dēiciō|abiciō}}
# {{lb|la|transitive}} to [[lift]], [[raise]], [[boost]]
#: {{syn|la|incendō|augeō}}
# to [[build]], [[erect]]
# {{lb|la|transitive}} to [[cause]] to [[halt]], [[stop]], because of the [[erect]] [[posture]] [[assumed]]
# {{lb|la|transitive}} to [[climb]], [[go]] [[upwards]]
