#: {{syn|la|effodiō}}
#: {{uxi|la|{{l|la|ager}} {{l|la|frugifer}}, {{l|la|argentum}} {{l|la|etiam}} {{l|la|incolae}} '''fodiunt'''|t=The soil is fertile, (and) inhabitants '''dig''' the silver also}}
# {{lb|la|transferred sense|classical}} to [[prick]], [[prod]], [[pierce]], [[thrust]], [[jab]], [[stab]], [[wound]]
#: {{syn|la|trānsfīgō|peragō|fīgō|intrō|trāiciō|percutiō|cōnfodiō|trānsigō}}
# {{lb|la|figuratively}} to [[goad]], [[sting]], [[disturb]]

