* {{desc|fr|forer}}
* {{desc|gl|furar}}
* {{desc|it|forare}}
* {{desc|pt|furar}}
* {{desc|es|horadar}}

===Etymology 2===
{{nonlemma}}

====Noun====
{{head|la|noun form|head=forō}}

