Page 2894 futuo: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
Ultimately from {{der|la|ine-pro|*bʰew-||to hit}}. Related to {{m|la|fūstis}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{la-IPA|futuō}}

===Verb===
{{la-verb|3|futuō|futu|futūt}}

# {{lb|la|vulgar}} to [[fuck]], to have [[vaginal sex]]
#* {{Q|la|Martial|Epigrammata|IX|69|quote=Cum '''futuis''', Polycharme, soles in fine cacare.|trans= When you '''fuck''', Polycharmus, you are accustomed to defecating afterwards}}
#* [[w:en:Marcus Valerius Martialis|Martial]], ''Epigrammata'', 11:20
#*: {{quote|la|"Aut '''futue''', aut [[pugno|pugnēmus]]" ait.|"Either '''fuck''' me or let's fight" she says.}}
#* [[w:en:Gaius Valerius Catullus|Catullus]], ''Carmina'', 97:9
#*: {{quote|la|Hic '''futuit''' multas et se facit esse venustum|He '''fucks''' lots of women, and makes himself out to be charming}}

====Usage notes====
* ''Futuō'' is used in the sense of penetrating, not of being penetrated.

