Meaning influenced by {{cog|VL.|*wadaniō||to pursue; graze}}, ultimately from {{cog|gem-pro|*waiþanjaną}}.<ref>{{R:es:DRAE|ganar}}</ref><ref>{{R:es:Roberts:2014|head=ganar|page=751}}</ref>

Documented from at least 973.<ref>{{R:Niermeyer|ganare|461}}</ref>

