Page 2913 gigno: -------- begin text --------

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|la|genō}}

===Etymology===
{{root|la|ine-pro|*ǵenh₁-}}
From {{der|la|ine-pro||*ǵíǵnh₁-}}, the reduplicated present stem of {{m|ine-pro|*ǵenh₁-}}. Cognate to {{cog|grc|γίγνομαι||to come into being, to be born, to take place}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{la-IPA|gignō|eccl=yes}}

===Verb===
{{la-verb|3|gignō|genu|genit}}

# to [[bring forth]] as a [[fruit]] of oneself: to [[bear]], to [[beget]], to [[engender]], to [[give birth]] to
