Possibly a denominal of {{der|la|ine-pro||*h₂enh₁-slo-|t=a breathing|pos=whence {{m+|la|anhēlus}}}}, from the root {{m|ine-pro|*h₂enh₁-|t=to breathe}}. The syncope of the second syllable is expected, while the {{ic|/h-/}} is unetymologycal and likely {{onomatopoeic|la|nocap=1}}.<ref>{{R:itc:EDL|hālō, -āre|279}}</ref><ref>{{R:ine:IEW}}</ref> Ultimately akin to {{m|la|animus|t=spirit}}.

