* {{sense|happen}} {{l|la|ēveniō}}, {{l|la|interveniō}}, {{l|la|obveniō}}, {{l|la|obtingō}}, {{l|la|accidō}}, {{l|la|accēdō}}, {{l|la|incurrō}}, {{l|la|contingō}}, {{l|la|intercidō}}, {{l|la|expetō}}, {{l|la|fīō}}
* {{sense|assault}} {{l|la|invādō}}, {{l|la|incurrō}}, {{l|la|impetō}}, {{l|la|aggredior}}, {{l|la|īnstō}}, {{l|la|inruō}}, {{l|la|excurrō}}, {{l|la|concurrō}}, {{l|la|occurrō}}, {{l|la|petō}}, {{l|la|accēdō}}, {{l|la|irrumpō}}, {{l|la|intrō}}, {{l|la|incēdō}}, {{l|la|adorior}}, {{l|la|adeō}}, {{l|la|opprimō}}, {{l|la|appetō}}, {{l|la|incessō}}, {{l|la|arripiō}}, {{l|la|lacessō}}

