# {{lb|la|military}} to [[bear]] the [[standards]] against the [[enemy]], [[attack]], [[make]] an attack upon; [[wage]] [[war]] on
#: {{uxi|la|Gigantes bellum dis '''intulerunt'''|The giants '''waged war''' against the gods}} ([[w:Cicero|Cicero]])
#* {{Q|la|[[w:Titus Livius|Titus Livius]]|[[w:Ab Urbe Condita Libri|Ab Urbe Condita]]|I, 2|quote=Aeneae Latinoque bellum '''intulerat'''|t=He '''waged war''' against the [[w:Aeneas|Aeneas]] and [[w:Latinus|Latinus]]}}
# {{lb|la|figuratively}} to bring forward, [[introduce]]; [[produce]], [[occasion]], make; [[conclude]]; [[import]]
