# to [[pursue]], [[chase]]
#: {{syn|la|persequor|cōnsequor|īnsequor|sequor|continuō|excipiō|exsequor|agō|premō|īnstō}}
# to [[blame]], [[rail]] at, [[inveigh]] against, [[speak]] [[ill]] of
