#* {{Q|la|[[w:Titus Livius|Titus Livius]]|[[w:Ab Urbe Condita Libri|Ab Urbe Condita]]|I, 15|quote={{l|la|Romanus}} [...]  {{l|la|dimicationi}} {{l|la|ultimae}} '''instructus''' {{l|la|intentus|intentusque}} {{l|la|Tiberim}} {{l|la|transit}}|t=[[w:Romulus|The Roman general]] intended and '''arrayed''' [his forces] for a decisive battle, crossed the [[w:Tiber|Tiber]]}}

