# to [[tie]], [[bind]]
#: {{syn|la|colligō|illigō|cōnserō|cōnfīgō|adalligō|dēligō|alligō|iniungō|nectō|cōnectō|dēfīgō|fīgō|vinculō|dēstinō}}
