#* {{Q|la|[[w:De vita Caesarum|De vita Caesarum]]|[[w:Suetonius|Suetonius]]|Vita divi Iuli, 45|quote=animo '''linqui''' [...] {{l|la|solebat}}|t=''he was accustomed to sudden '''fainting fits'''''}}

