#: {{syn|la|aspiciō|perlūstrō|recēnseō|circumspiciō|cōnspiciō|obeō|īnspiciō|arbitror|cōnsīderō|spectō|reputō|exsequor}}
#* {{Q|la|Virgil|Aeneid|2|564|quote=“Respiciō et quae sit mē circum cōpia '''lūstrō'''.”|trans=''“I look back and '''survey''' what force is there around me.”''}}
