Page 3731 maneo: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
From {{der|la|ine-pro|*men-||to stay, stand still}} (with ''mānsum'' influenced by ''mānsī''), related to {{cog|fa|ماندن|tr=mândan||to remain}}, {{cog|grc|μένω||I remain}}.

===Pronunciation===
