From {{m|la|mūgiō}}. The ending seems to be {{af|la|nocat=1|-īnus|-ō|alt2=-or|id2=denominative}}; compare {{m|la|natinor}}, {{m|la|vīcīnor}}, {{m|la|vulpinor}}, etc.

===Pronunciation===
* {{la-IPA|mūgīnor}}

===Verb===
{{la-verb|1+|mūgīnor}}

# {{lb|la|rare|intransitive}} to [[murmur]]
# {{lb|la|intransitive}} to [[hesitate]], [[ponder]], [[brood]]

====Conjugation====
{{la-conj|1+|mūgīnor}}

===References===
* {{R:L&S}}
* {{R:Elementary Lewis}}
* {{R:Gaffiot}}
