#* {{quote-book|la|year=1804|author=Friedrich Colland|title=Fundamenta artis obstetriciae|page=48|text=In lecto enim quaelibet partum absolvere potest, in sella obstetricia autem solumodo tunc licet, si caput nimis grande, aut parturiens sellam jam consueta esset, quia caput grande ob propriam gravitatem facilius '''oblongatur''', & citius, dum parturiens majori vi dolores elaborare valet, per exitum pelvis transit.}}

