# to [[wish]] for, [[hope]] for, [[long]] for, [[desire]]
#* {{Q|la|Virgil|Aeneid|1|76-77|quote=Aeolus haec contrā: “Tuus, Ō rēgīna, quid '''optēs'''<br/>explōrāre labor; mihi iussa capessere fās est.”|trans=Aeolus [spoke] these [words] in reply: “Your task, O Queen [Juno], [is] to consider what '''you desire'''; for me it is right to carry out [divine] commands.”}}

