#: {{syn|la|subigō|subiciō|dēvincō|vincō|conquestō|superō|ēvincō|expugnō|domō|prōflīgō|caedō|exsuperō|obruō|opprimō|premō|fundō}}

====Conjugation====
Note that pluperfect active indicative {{m|la|pepulerat}} has the alternative form {{m|la|pulserat}} and that the perfect active indicative {{m|la|pepulī}} has the alternative form {{m|la|polsī}}.
