===Etymology===
{{unc|la}}, suggestions include:
* from {{m|la|contus||stick, pole; plummet}}, as if ''"to probe, to feel the depth with a (long) pole"'';
* from {{m|la|cūnctor}} (this appears semantically unconvincing and more likely simply influenced by it, as in the Vulgar Latin derivative below, but compare {{m+|ja|掛ける}}); {{rfv-etym|la}}
* from {{der|la|ine-pro|*preḱ-||to ask}}.

===Pronunciation===
