Page 4482 possideo: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
{{root|la|ine-pro|*sed-}}
From {{m|la|potis||able}} + {{m|la|sedeō||sit}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{la-IPA|possideō}}

===Verb===
{{la-verb|2|possideō|possēd|possess}}

# to [[have]], [[hold]], [[own]], [[possess]]
#: {{syn|la|habeo|obtineō|teneo}}
