# to [[exhibit]], to [[show]]
#: {{syn|la|praebeō|ostendō|ostentō|expōnō|prōpōnō|prōdō|acclārō|indicō|prōferō|prōtrahō|fateor|profiteor|vulgō|coarguō|gerō}}
# {{lb|la|reflexive}} to [[prove]] (oneself), to [[show]] (oneself)
# {{lb|la|Late Latin|Medieval Latin}} to [[lend]], [[loan]]

