Cognate with {{cog|sa|पृच्छति||to ask}}, {{cog|got|𐍆𐍂𐌰𐌹𐌷𐌽𐌰𐌽||to ask}}, {{cog|ang|freġnan}}, {{m|ang|friġnan||to ask, inquire, learn}} and {{cog|ru|просить||to ask, implore, request}}. More at {{l|en|frain}}.

