* {{sense|lop}} {{l|la|amputō}}, {{l|la|discindō}}, {{l|la|intercidō}}, {{l|la|incīdō}}, {{l|la|discerpō}}
* {{sense|think}} {{l|la|cōgitō}}, {{l|la|sentio}}, {{l|la|arbitror}}, {{l|la|existimo}}, {{l|la|opinor}}, {{l|la|credo}}
* {{sense|consider}}  {{l|la|considero}}, {{l|la||perpendō}}, {{l|la|reputo}}, {{l|la|arbitror}}, {{l|la|existimo}}, {{l|la|iudico}}, {{l|la|censeo}}, {{l|la|cogito}}, {{l|la|reor}}
* {{sense|ponder}} {{l|la|reflectō}}, {{l|la|ponderō}}, {{l|la|pendō}}, {{l|la|cōnsīderō}}, {{l|la|dēlīberō}}, {{l|la|reputō}}, {{l|la|cōnsulō}}, {{l|la|replicō}}, {{l|la|dubitō}}, {{l|la|cōnsultō}}, {{l|la|circumspiciō}}, {{l|la|videō}}, {{l|la|trahō}}, {{l|la|versō}}

