* {{sense|tolerate}} {{l|la|tolerō}}, {{l|la|sustineō}}, {{l|la|patiō}}, {{l|la|perferō}}, {{l|la|accipiō}}, {{l|la|sufferō}}, {{l|la|subeō}}, {{l|la|sustentō}}, {{l|la|sinō}}, {{l|la|dūrō}}, {{l|la|perpetior}}, {{l|la|ferō}}
