Page 4882 reddo: -------- begin text --------

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|la|rendō||Late Latin}}

===Etymology===
{{root|la|ine-pro|*deh₃-}}
From {{af|la|re-|*dere|t2=put/give}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{la-IPA|reddō}}

===Verb===
{{la-verb|3|reddō|reddid|reddit}}

# to [[give back]], [[return]], [[restore]]
#: {{syn|la|remittō}}
#: {{ant|la|recipiō|reciperō|revocō}}
#* {{w|Suetonius}}, ''{{w|De vita Caesarum}}'':
#*: {{quote|la|Quintili Vare, legiones '''redde'''!|t=O Quintilius Varus! '''Give [me] back''' [my] legions!}}
# to [[give up]], [[hand]] over, [[deliver]], [[render]], [[provide]], [[assign]]
#: {{syn|la|dēserō|relinquō|omittō|dēdō|concēdō|dēcēdō|dēstituō|dēficiō|oblīvīscor|cēdō|dissimulō|trādō|addīcō|praetereō|neglegō|pōnō|remittō|permittō|tribuō}}
# to [[surrender]], [[relinquish]], [[deliver]], [[yield]], [[resign]]
#: {{syn|la|dēdō|addīcō|concēdō|dēcēdō|committō|remittō|trādō|tribuō|dēferō|dō|cēdō|permittō}}
# to give or [[pay back]]; take [[revenge]] for, [[punish]], inflict [[vengeance]] for
# to [[repeat]], [[declare]], [[report]], [[narrate]], [[recite]], [[rehearse]]
# to [[represent]], [[imitate]], [[express]], [[resemble]]
# to [[make]] something [[look]] in a certain way, make or [[cause]] a thing to [[be]] or [[appear]] something or somehow, [[render]]
#: {{syn|la|dō|afferō}}
#* {{Q|la|Terence|Adelphoe|5|3|59|thru=63|quote=DĒMEA. Ego istuc vīderō,<br>atque ibi favīllae plēna, fūmī ac pollinis<br>coquendō sit faxō et molendō. Praeter haec<br>merīdiē ipsō faciam ut stipulam colligat.<br>Tam excoctam '''reddam''' atque ātram quam carbō est.|trans=DEMEA. I'll see to that,<br>and full of soot, smoke and flour<br>from the cooking and grinding I'll make her. And, besides that,<br>I'll make her collect the straw at noon.<br>I'll '''render''' her as burnt and black as coal.}}
#* {{Q|la|Terence|Andria|2|3|14|thru=16|quote={{...}}Hīc '''reddēs''' omnia<br>quae nunc sunt certa eī cōnsilia incerta ut sient,<br>sine omnī periclō.{{...}}|trans=Here you '''make''' all those plans which are now certain to him '''seem''' uncertain, without any risk.}}
# to [[return]] in profit
#* [[Martial]] 2.38:
#*: {{ux|la|Quid mihi '''reddat''' ager quaeris, Line, Nōmentānus?<br>Hoc mihi '''reddit''' ager: tē, Line, nōn videō!|You ask, Linus, what profit the field in Nomentum might return to me?<br/>This, Linus, [is what] the field gives back to me: not having to see you!}}
#: {{ux|la|Vestis virum '''reddit'''.|The clothes '''profit''' the man.}}

====Conjugation====
{{la-conj|3|reddō|reddid|reddit}}

====Derived terms====
* {{l|la|redditiō}}
* {{l|la|redditor}}
* {{l|la|redditus}}

====Descendants====
{{q|See also {{m|la|rendō}}.}}
