# {{lb|la|New Latin|reflexive}} to {{l|en|renew}} oneself
#* '''''ante'' 1503''', [[w:Antonio Bonfini|Antonius Bonfinius]], ''[[:la:w:Rerum Ungaricarum decades|Rerum Vngaricarum decades tres]]'' (1543), decade III, book iv, page 417:
#*: {{lang|la|Gubernatorem interregis loco creare licuiſſet, declinaſſent huiuſce belli pericula, quę comitijs quibuſque regalibus '''redintegraſcunt'''.}}
#* '''1526–7''', {{w|Johannes Oporinus}} (author), {{w|Karl Sudhoff}} (editor), ''De vita longa'' in {{lang|de|sc=Latf|[[w:Paracelsus|Theophraſt von Hohenheim, gen. Paracelsus,]] Sämtliche Werke}}, division I: {{lang|de|sc=Latf|Mediziniſche naturwiſſenſchaftliche und philoſophiſche Schriften}}, volume III (1930), {{gbooks|291MAQAAMAAJ|254|redintegrascit}}:
#*: {{quote|la|{{lang|la|[P]raeterea vita longa tanquam homo existit nobis, ut ignis ligno insitus, quo '''redintegrascit''' homo.}}}}
#* {{quote-text|la|year=1680|author=[[w:Louis Thomassin|Ludovicus Thomassinus]]|title=Dogmatum Theologicorum prior prodit De Verbi Dei Incarnatione|section=book VI, chapter vii, § xiii, [http://books.google.com/books?id=OKxQAAAAcAAJ&pg=PA431&dq=%22redintegrasceret%22 pages 431-2]
|passage={{lang|la|Et quantum inde '''redintegraſceret'''<!-- page break here in the source --> morbus?}}}}

====Conjugation====
{{la-conj|3.nopass|redintegrāscō}}

