Page 4900 refero: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
{{root|la|ine-pro|*bʰer-|*telh₂-|id2=bear}}
From {{affix|la|re-|ferō|gloss2=bear, carry}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{la-IPA|referō}}

===Verb===
{{la-verb|irreg|referō|ret|re}}

# to [[bear]], [[bring]], [[drive]] or [[carry]] back
#: {{syn|la|reveho}}
# to [[give back]], [[give up]], [[return]], [[restore]], [[pay back]], [[repay]], pay in return, show one's gratitude
# {{lb|la|of sound}} to bring back, [[return]], [[answer]], [[echo]], [[resound]]
# to bring back, [[restore]], [[renew]], [[revive]], [[repeat]]
# to [[say]] in return, [[respond]], [[reply]], [[answer]], [[represent]]
#: {{syn|la|respondeo|occurro}}
# to [[call to mind]], [[recall]], [[think over]], call back to memory, repeat one's self
#: {{syn|la|memorō|admoneō|moneō|retineō|meminī|redūcō}}
#: {{ant|la|oblīvīscor|oblitterō}}
#* {{Q|la|Ovid|Fasti|2|104|quote=liceat sūmpta pauca '''referre''' lyra|trans=''Let me take up my lyre '''to recall''' a few [notes].''}}
# to [[reconsider]]
# to [[refer]] to, [[assign]] to, give [[credit]] for
# to [[judge]] by, measure according to a certain standard
# to [[restore]], [[renew]], [[revive]], [[repeat]]
#: {{syn|la|iterō|integrō|redintegrō|renovō|novō|reficiō|reparō}}
# (news or message) [[relate]], [[recount]], [[tell]], [[say]]
#: {{syn|la|oro|alloquor|loquor|for|aio|alloquor|loquor|colloquor}}
# (matter of import, to the senate) to [[bring]] before, [[refer]] to
#: {{syn|la|propono}}
# (name or item in a list) to [[include]], [[enter]]
# to make [[known]] [[officially]], [[report]], [[deliver]], [[transmit]], [[announce]], [[notify]], [[proclaim]], [[register]], [[record]]
#: {{syn|la|dēnūntiō|adnuntio|nuntio|indico|renūntiō|nū̆ncupō|profiteor|dēferō|prōdō|ēdīcō|praedicō|cōntiōnor}}
# (passive) to [[retreat]], [[go back]], [[withdraw]], [[return]]
#: {{syn|la|facessō|dēcēdō|discēdō|cēdō|dēficiō|concēdō|excēdō|regredior|subtrahō|subdūcō|inclīnō|recēdō|āmoveō|recipiō|vertō}}
#: {{ant|la|prōgredior|prōdeō|prōcēdō|prōficiō|aggredior|ēvehō|incēdō|accēdō|adeō}}
#* {{Q|la|[[w:Titus Livius|Titus Livius]]|[[w:Ab Urbe Condita Libri|Ab Urbe Condita]]|I, 14|quote={{l|la|pedes}} {{l|la|quoque}} '''referret''' {{l|la|gradum}}|t=The infantry also '''retreated''' from his position}}
# to [[tell]], [[recount]], [[narrate]]
#: {{syn|la|ferō|prōdō|pandō|trādō|dicitur}}

====Usage notes====
* The forms "rettul..." are also found as "retul...".

====Conjugation====
{{la-conj|irreg|referō|ret|re}}

