# {{lb|la|figuratively}} to [[laugh]], [[smile]] (back)
# {{lb|la|figuratively|with dative}} to smile upon; to be [[gracious]] to

====Conjugation====
{{la-conj|2.nopass|renīdeō|renīdu}}

====Derived terms====
