#: {{syn|la|habitō|obsideō|cōnsīdō|possideō|subsīdō|stabulō|iaceō|incolō|colō|vīvō|versō}}
# to [[remain]] [[sit]]ting
#* {{Q|la|Virgil|Aeneid|1|505-506|quote=Tum foribus dīvae, mediā testūdine templī,<br/>saepta armīs, soliōque altē subnīxa '''resēdit'''.|trans=''Then, [facing the] doorway of the goddess [Juno], [there] in the middle beneath the vault of the temple, surrounded by armed guards, and supported by the lofty throne, [Dido] '''remained seated'''.''}}
# to [[sit up]]
# {{lb|la|figuratively}} to be [[idle]], [[inactive]]
#: {{syn|la|dēsideō|vacō|langueō|cessō|iaceō|sileō|conquiēscō}}
# to remain [[behind]], be [[leave behind|left behind]]

