===Etymology===
{{unc|la}} origin. Roberts assigns {{der|la|ine-pro|*wert-}} in the sense of turning the mouth to smile; de Vaan finds no credible Indo-European origin and rejects connections to {{cog|sa|व्रीडते||to be shy, bashful}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{la-IPA|rīdeō}}

===Verb===
{{la-verb|2|rīdeō|rīs|rīs}}

