#: {{syn|la|cachinnō}}
#: {{ant|la|fleō}}
# {{lb|la|transitive}} to [[laugh]] at, [[ridicule]], [[mock]]
#: {{syn|la|lūdificō|ēlūdō|trādūcō}}
#* {{Q|la|Ovid|Fasti|2|356|quote='''rīdet''' amātōrem Lȳdā puella suum.|trans=''The Lydian girl '''laughs at''' her [would-be] lover.''}}
#* {{Q|la|Terence|Eunuchus|3|497|quote=GNATHŌ: Hahahae.<br>THRASŌ: Quid '''rīdēs'''?|trans=GNATHO: Hahaha!<br>THRASO: What are you '''laughing''' at?}}

