Page 5236 sentio: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
{{root|la|ine-pro|*sent-|id=feel}}
From {{inh|la|itc-pro|*sentjō}}, from {{der|la|ine-pro|*sent-||to feel}}. Cognate with {{cog|lt|sintėti||to think}}, {{cog|goh|sinnan||to go; desire}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{la-IPA|sentiō|eccl=1}}
* {{audio|la|la-cls-sentio.ogg|Audio (Classical)}}

===Verb===
{{la-verb|4|sentiō|sēns|sēns}}

# to [[feel]], to [[sense]], to [[perceive]] (with the [[sense]]s)
#: {{syn|la|sapiō|percipiō|cōnspicor}}
#* {{Q|la|Ovid|Metamorphoses|1|553|quote=Hanc quoque Phoebus amat positāque in stīpite dextrā<br/>'''sentit''' adhūc trepidāre novō sub cortice pectus.|trans=But yet Phoebus loves her in this form and pressing his right hand <br/>'''he feels''' still the trembling heart under the bark.}}
# to [[perceive]], be [[aware]] of, to be [[sensible]] of, to [[notice]] [[mentally]], to [[understand]] (by using one's senses)
#: {{syn|la|agnōscō|cognōscō|inveniō|cōnsciō|sapiō|sciō|nōscō|scīscō|intellegō|percipiō|discernō|tongeō|cernō|audiō}}
#: {{ant|la|ignōrō|nesciō}}
#* {{Q|la|Julius Caesar|Bello Gallico|4|14|quote=Prius ad hostium castra pervēnit quam quid agerētur Germānī '''sentīre''' possent.|trans=He arrived at the camp of the enemy before the Germans could '''perceive''' what was going on.}}
# to have an [[opinion]], to [[think]], to [[feel]]
#: {{syn|la|arbitror|opinor|cōgitō|existimo|reor|puto|reputo|iudico|censeo}}
#* {{Q|la|Tacitus|Histories|1|1|quote={{...}}ubi '''sentīre''' quae velīs et quae '''sentiās''' dīcere licet.|trans={{...}}where '''to feel''' what you wish, and what '''you feel''' to say, is permitted.}}
# to [[feel]] (an [[emotion]])
# to [[agree]] {{gloss|typically followed by {{m|la|cum}}}}
# {{lb|la|Late Latin|Ecclesiastical Latin}} (figuratively) to [[meet]]
#* {{Q|la|Jerome|Vulgate|Proverbs|13|3|quote=Quī custōdit ōs suum custōdit animam suam: quī autem incōnsīderātus est ad loquendum '''sentiet''' mala.|trans=''He that keepeth his mouth, keepeth his soul: but he that hath no guard on his speech '''shall meet'''  with evils.'' (Douay-Rheims trans., Challoner rev.: '''1752''' CE)}}

====Conjugation====
{{la-conj|4|sentiō|sēns|sēns}}

