# {{inflection of|la|sonus||dat//abl|s}}

===Etymology 2===
From {{inh|la|itc-pro|*swonāō}}, from {{der|la|ine-pro|*swenh₂-||to sound, resound}}; cognate to {{cog|sa|स्वनति||to sound, resound}}, {{cog|sla-pro|*zvoniti|t=to ring}}.

