# {{lb|la|transitive}} to [[cry out]], [[call]]; [[sing]]; [[celebrate]], [[praise]], [[extol]]

=====Conjugation=====
{{la-conj|1|sonō|sonu|sonit}}
There are the alternative forms: [[sonere]], for the present active infinitive, [[sonare|sonāre]], thus third conjugation forms exist in early Latin with [[sonit]] for [[sonat]] and [[sonunt]] for [[sonant#Latin|sonant]] in the present tense; there is also the alternative form [[sonaturum|sonātūrum]] for the future active participle [[soniturus|sonitūrus]].

