Page 5309 spero: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
From {{der|la|ine-pro|*speh₁-||to prosper, to turn out well}}, (compare {{cog|hit|tr=išpai}}, {{cog|ae|𐬯𐬞𐬆𐬥𐬎𐬎𐬀𐬙-}}, {{cog|sa|स्फायते||to grow fat|tr=sphā́yate}}, {{cog|lt|spėti}}, {{cog|cu|спѣти}}, {{cog|xto|spāw-||to subside, run dry}}), {{cog|en|speed}}. Some make this the same root as {{der|la|ine-pro|*speh₁-||to stretch, to pull}}, whence {{m|la|pēnūria}}, {{m|la|spatium}}, {{cog|grc|σπάω}}, {{m|grc|πένομαι}}, {{m|grc|πένης}}, {{m|grc|πόνος}}, {{m|grc|πεῖνα}}, {{m|grc|σπάνις}}, {{cog|en|span}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{la-IPA|spērō}}

===Verb===
{{la-verb|1+.poet-sync-perf|spērō}}

# to [[hope]], [[expect]]
#: {{syn|la|exspectō}}
