{{root|la|ine-pro|*sterh₃-}}
From {{inh|la|itc-pro|*stornō}}, from {{der|la|ine-pro||*str̥-n-h₃-}}, n-infix present of the root {{m|ine-pro|*sterh₃-}}. Cognate with {{cog|sa|आस्तॄ||spread}}, {{cog|ae|𐬯𐬙𐬆𐬭𐬆𐬥𐬁𐬌𐬙𐬌|t=spread, extend}}, {{cog|grc|στόρνυμι||scatter}}, {{m|grc|στρατός||army, people, body of men}}, {{cog|cu|прострѣти||stretch, expand}}, {{m|cu|просторъ||spaciousness}}, {{cog|ang|strewian}} ({{cog|en|strew}}), {{cog|non|strá}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{la-IPA|sternō}}

===Verb===
{{la-verb|3|sternō|strāv|strāt}}

# {{lb|la|transitive}} to [[spread]], [[stretch out]], [[spread out]]
#: {{syn|la|cōnfundō|effundō|fundō|diffundō|dēfundō|differō|indūcō|dissipō}}
# {{lb|la|transitive|rare}} to [[calm]], [[still]], [[moderate]]
# {{lb|la|transitive}} to [[cover]], [[spread]] with, [[scatter]] with, [[bestrew]] with, [[besprinkle]]
# {{lb|la|transitive|of a road, path}} to [[pave]], [[cover]]
# {{lb|la|transitive}} to [[stretch]] on the ground, [[throw]] to the ground, [[cast]] down, [[strike down]], [[prostrate]]
#: {{syn|la|prōsternō|fundō|prōflīgō|impellō|ruō|subvertō|pervertō|ēvertō|dēturbō|versō|afflīgō}}
