#: {{syn|la|prōflīgō|impellō|subvertō|fundō|pervertō|ēvertō|dēturbō|prōsternō|afflīgō|dissipō|vertō|versō}}
#* {{circa|13th C.}}, ''[[w:O Fortuna|O Fortuna]]'', lines 34-36:
