# to [[throw]], [[lay]], [[place]], [[set]] or [[bring]] [[under]] or [[near]]
#: {{syn|la|suggerō|summittō|sufferō|suppōnō}}
#* {{Q|la|Virgil|Aeneid|2|235-237|quote=“Accingunt omnēs operī, pedibusque rotārum / '''subiciunt''' lāpsūs, et stuppea vincula collō / intendunt [...].”|trans=''“All [the Trojans] set to work, and '''we place''' sliding rollers '''under''' the [wooden horse’s] feet, and stretch out hempen ropes to its neck.”''}}
# to [[subdue]]
#: {{syn|la|subigō|dēvincō|vincō|conquestō|superō|expugnō|domō|ēvincō|prōflīgō|caedō|obruō|exsuperō|pellō|opprimō|premō|fundō}}
