Page 5483 suesco: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
{{PIE word|la|swé}}
{{root|la|ine-pro|*dʰeh₁-}}
From {{der|la|ine-pro|*swe-dʰh₁-sḱ-}}, expanded from the reflexive pronoun {{der|la|ine-pro|*swé||self}} + {{m|ine-pro|*dʰeh₁-||to put, place, set}}, thus the original sense to "set as one's own", as in the later formed {{m|la|suificō}}.

Cognate with {{m|la|soleō}}, {{m|la|sodālis}}, {{cog|grc|ἔθω}}, {{m|grc|εἴωθα}}, {{m|grc|ἔθνος}}, {{m|grc|ἔθος}}, {{m|grc|ἦθος}}, {{cog|sa|स्वधा}} and {{cog|got|𐍃𐌹𐌳𐌿𐍃}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{la-IPA|svēscō}}

===Verb===
