# {{lb|la|intransitive|rare|poetic}} to become [[used]] or [[accustomed]] to
# {{lb|la|transitive|rare|post-Classical}} to [[accustom]], [[habituate]], [[train]]

====Usage notes====
This verb is rare and poetic, and prefixed forms such as {{m|la|adsuēsco}} are more frequent.

