* {{m|la|esat|Esat}} is an early form of {{m|la|erat}}
* {{m|la|esed|Esed}} is an early form of {{m|la|erit}} / {{m|la|esset}} / {{m|la|estō}}.
* {{m|la|essis|Essis}} is an alternate form of {{m|la|es}}
* {{m|la|eso|Eso}} is an early form of {{m|la|ero}}
* {{m|la|esum|Esum}} is an alternate form of {{m|la|sum}}
* {{m|la|fuam|Fuam}} is an alternate form of {{m|la|sim}}
* {{m|la|fueit|Fueit}} is an alternate form of {{m|la|fuit}}
* {{m|la|fuvimus|Fuvimus}} is an alternate form of {{m|la|fuimus}}
* {{m|la|fuvisset|Fuvisset}} is an alternate form of {{m|la|fuisset}}
* {{m|la|siēd|Siēd}} is an early form of {{m|la|sit}}.

