Of {{uncertain|la|nocap=1}} origin<ref>{{R:la:WH|head=taedet|page=642|vol=2}}</ref>; proposed derivations include:
* A relation with {{m|la|taeter|t=foul, loathsome}}.
* From a {{der|la|ine-pro|-}} root common with {{cog|lt|tingùs|t=lazy}}, {{cog|sla-pro|*tęžьkъ|t=heavy}} and maybe {{cog|grc|σικχός|t=squeamish, fastidious person}}.

