#: {{syn|la|invado|occurro|incurrō|concurro|aggredior|adorior|insto|peto|intrō|invado|adeo}}
# to [[test]]
#: {{syn|la|periclitor|probō|experior|spectō|explōrō}}
# to [[try]], [[attempt]]
#: {{syn|la|lūctor|certō|cōnītor|cōnor|ēnītor|appetō|affectō|ēlabōrō|tendō|quaerō|studeō|contendō|adnītor|labōrō|pugnō|molior|perīclitor|nītor|spectō}}
# to [[urge]], [[incite]], [[rouse]]
#: {{syn|la|inflammo|flammo|eccito|instinguo|instigo|excio}}
# to [[handle]], [[touch]]
#: {{syn|la|tango|contingo}}

