Cognate with {{cog|ae|𐬙𐬭𐬆𐬭𐬆𐬯𐬀𐬌𐬙𐬌}}, {{cog|grc|τρέω}}, {{cog|sga|tarrach}}, {{cog|lt|trišu}}, {{cog|lv|trisēt}}, {{cog|cu|трѧсти}}, {{cog|sa|त्रसति}}. See also {{m|la|tremō}}, {{m|la|trepidus}}.

