Page 5677 tolero: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
From {{inh|la|itc-pro|*tolazāō}}, from {{der|la|ine-pro|*telh₂-||to bear, carry}}. Compare {{cog|grc|τλάντος||bearing, suffering}}, {{m|grc|τολμάω||to carry, bear}}, {{m|grc|τελαμών||broad strap for bearing something}}, {{m|grc|Ἄτλας||the 'Bearer' of Heaven}}, {{cog|lt|tiltas||bridge}}, {{cog|sa|तुला||balance}}, {{m|sa|तुलयति||lifts up, weighs}}, {{cog|la|tollō||to bear, support}}, {{m|la|tulī||I bore}}, {{m|la|lātus||borne}}, {{m|la|tellūs||bearing earth}}, {{cog|ang|þolian||to endure}} (English {{m|en|thole}}), Old Armenian {{m|xcl|թողում||I allow}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{la-IPA|tolerō}}

===Verb===
{{la-verb|1+.poet-sync-perf|tolerō}}

