Page 5690 torreo: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
{{root|la|ine-pro|*ters-}}
From {{inh|la|itc-pro|*torzeō}}, from {{inh|la|ine-pro|*torséyeti}}, causative from the root {{m|ine-pro|*ters-||dry}}. The fourth principal part {{m|la|tostum}} is for {{m|la||*torstum}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{la-IPA|torreō}}

===Verb===
{{la-verb|2|torreō|torru|tō̆st}}

# to [[scorch]], [[burn]], [[parch]]
# to [[roast]], [[bake]]
# {{lb|la|of the cold}} to [[nip]], [[pinch]]

====Usage notes====
* While {{m|la||*torstum}} is almost certainly {{m|la||*tŏrstum}} with a short vowel, the vowel of {{m|la|tostum}} is less understood; whether it is {{m|la||tŏstum}} or {{m|la||tōstum}} is properly unknown.

====Conjugation====
{{la-conj|2|torreō|torru|tō̆st}}

