Page 5773 tuburcinor: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
De Vaan<ref>{{R:itc:EDL|tūber|632}}</ref> speculatively identifies this verb with {{m|la|tūber||swelling}}. According to this theory, ''tuburcinor'' originally meant "to be(come) a fat, stuffed person (by eating greedily)", and is derived from a noun {{m|und|*tūbVrko-||fat person}} (where ''V'' is an unspecified vowel), ultimately from {{der|la|ine-pro|*tewh₂-||to swell}}. 

===Pronunciation===
* {{la-IPA|tuburcinor}}

