From {{inh|la|itc-pro|*tumēō}}, from {{der|la|ine-pro||*tum-éh₁-|to be swelling}}, stative verb of {{m|ine-pro|*tum-||to swell}}.<ref>{{R:itc:EDL|tumeō|633}}</ref>

Cognates include {{cog|la|tūber}}, {{cog|sa|तुम्र|tr=túmra||big, strong}} and {{m|sa|तूतुम|tr=tūtumá||strong, effective}}, {{cog|lt|tumė́ti||to become thick}}, {{cog|grc|τύμβος||swell}}.

