#: {{syn|la|margarīta|bāca}}
#* {{Q|la|Pliny the Elder|Naturalis Historia|9|115|quote=namque et Juba trādit Arabicīs concham esse similem pectinī īnsectō, hirsūtam echīnorum modō, ipsum '''ūniōnem''' in carne grandinī similem.}}

