{{root|la|ine-pro|*weǵʰ-}}
From {{inh|la|itc-pro|*weɣō}}, from {{inh|la|ine-pro|*wéǵʰeti}}, from the root {{m|ine-pro|*weǵʰ-|t=to ride}}. Cognate with {{cog|grc-arp|ϝέχω}}, {{cog|sa|वहति}}, {{cog|fa|وز|tr=vaz}}, {{cog|ang|wegan}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{la-IPA|vehō}}

===Verb===
{{la-verb|3|vehō|vex|vect}}

# to [[carry]], [[bear]], [[convey]], [[transport]]
#: {{syn|la|ferō|portō|trahō|agō|vectō|dūcō|gerō|efferō|dēdūcō|prōdūcō|addūcō|trādūcō}}
# {{lb|la|passive}} to [[ride]]; to be [[borne]]

====Usage notes====
* May be used to mean carried by a person, riding a horse, ferried by ship, and many other means of conveyance. Uses ablative of means.

====Conjugation====
{{la-conj|3|vehō|vex|vect}}

====Derived terms====
{{col3|la|advehō|convehō|ēvehō|invehō|prōvehō|subvehō|trānsvehō|vectis|vectō|vector|vehiculum|vectuarius}}

====Related terms====
* {{l|la|vectīgal}}

====Descendants====
* {{desc|io|vehar|bor=1}}

====References====
* {{R:L&S}}
* {{R:Elementary Lewis}}
* {{R:Gaffiot}}
* {{R:M&A}}
