** {{desc|fr|vérifier|bor=1}}
*** {{desc|en|verify|bor=1}}
** {{desc|gl|verificar|bor=1}}
** {{desc|io|verifikar|bor=1}}
** {{desc|it|verificare|bor=1}}
*** {{desc|ro|verifica|bor=1}}
** {{desc|pt|verificar|bor=1}}
** {{desc|es|verificar|bor=1}}
{{bottom}}

====References====
