===Etymology===
{{root|la|ine-pro|*wert-}}
From {{inh|la|itc-pro|*wertō}}, from {{inh|la|ine-pro|*wértti}}.

Cognates include {{cog|sa|वर्तते|tr=vártate||to turn}}, {{cog|ae|𐬬𐬀𐬭𐬆𐬙}}, {{cog|ru|вертеть||to rotate}}), {{cog|bat-pro|*wert-}} ({{cog|lt|ver̃sti}}), {{cog|fa|گرد|tr=gard||grow; turn}}, {{cog|gem-pro|*werþaną||to become}} ({{cog|ang|weorþan||to happen}}, {{cog|en|worth}}), {{cog|sga|dofortad||to pour out}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{la-IPA|vertō}}

===Verb===
{{la-verb|3|vertō|vert|vers}}

