#: {{syn|la|versō|advertō|circumagō}}
#: {{uxi|la|tergum/terga '''vertere'''|t=be on the run, to escape}}
# to [[turn upside down]], [[overturn]], [[overthrow]], [[subvert]], [[destroy]]
