# to [[exchange]], [[interchange]]
# {{lb|la|of literary productions}} to [[translate]], turn into another [[language]]
#: {{syn|la|trānsferō}}
# to [[retreat]]
#: {{syn|la|decedo|discedo|cedo|deficio|concēdō|excēdō|regredior|subtrahō|subdūcō|inclīnō|recēdō|āmoveō|recipiō|referō|facessō}}
#: {{ant|la|prōgredior|prōdeō|prōcēdō|prōficiō|aggredior|ēvehō|incēdō|accēdō|adeō}}

