===Verb===
{{la-verb|3|vēscor}}

# {{lb|la|with accusative or ablative}} to [[eat]], [[feed]] upon
#: {{syn|la|adedō|edō|vorō|prandeō|pāscor|cēnō|cōnsūmō}}
#* {{Q|la|[[w:Titus Livius|Titus Livius]]|[[w:Ab Urbe Condita Libri|Ab Urbe Condita]]|I, 7|quote={{l|la|ne}} {{l|la|extis}} [...] '''vescerentur'''|t=Should not '''eat''' of the entrails}}
# {{lb|la|with accusative or ablative}} to [[make use of]], [[enjoy]], [[use]]
#: {{syn|la|adhibeō|sūmō|assūmō|ūtor|ūsūrpō}}
# {{lb|la|intransitive}} to eat

====Usage notes====
* The verb {{m-self|la|vēscor}} and others like it, {{m|la|fruor}}, {{m|la|fungor}}, {{m|la|ūtor}}, {{m|la|potior}}, and their compounds, regularly [[wikipedia:Case government|govern]] the [[ablative]] case.
*: {{ux|la|Lacte et ferīnā carne '''vescēbantur'''.|They '''fed''' on milk and game.}}

