From {{inh|la|itc-pro|*wegēō}} (with unexpected ''i''), from {{inh|la|ine-pro|*weǵ-eh₁-(ye)-}}, stative verb from {{m|ine-pro|*weǵ-||to be lively}}, same ultimate source of {{cog|en|wake}}. Compare with the causative {{m|la|vegeō}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{la-IPA|vigeō}}

===Verb===
{{la-verb|2.nopass|vigeō|vigu}}

# to be [[vigorous]] or [[thriving]]; [[thrive]], [[flourish]]
#: {{syn|la|polleo|possum|valeō|praevaleō|queō}}
#: {{ant|la|nequeō}}
# to be in [[honor]], [[esteem]] or [[repute]]; [[prosper]]
# to be [[alive]], [[live]]

====Conjugation====
{{la-conj|2.nopass|vigeō|vigu}}

====Derived terms====
